{"product_id":"sweet-tobacco-i-love-salts","title":"Sweet Tobacco by I Love Salts","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSweet Cavendish tobacco naturally mimics the flavor of vanilla when barrel aged. The rough and earthy edge of tobacco has never been smoothed over so seamlessly. Sweet Tobacco I Love Salts manages to capture the essence of creamy Cavendish tobacco and the nic salt inhale is positively silken. If you are looking for a sophisticated tobacco nic salt, this is the flavor for you. I Love Salts are sold in 30ml bottles and come in 2.5 and 5.0 percent nic strength.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWanna try more flavours? Choose your favourite \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/i-love-salts-e-juice\" title=\"I love salts\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eI Love Salts\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e from our collection. Else, shop from our \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\" title=\"nicotine liquid Kenya\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003enicotine liquid Kenya\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e collection with more than +150 salts option.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"I LOVE SALTS","offers":[{"title":"5.0% (50mg)","offer_id":41670484983863,"sku":"SWEET TOBACCO BY I LOVE SALTS 5","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"2.5% (25mg)","offer_id":41670